DESNZ consults on heat pump sales targets for boiler makers, years 3–6

Scheme participants (heating appliance manufacturers) carry the target obligation and will pass compliance costs into appliance prices paid by households installing heating;

https://www.doloop.energy/item/180a2d481215dccb

Boiler makers' heat pump quota to rise to 18% by 2030/31, with new loosening flexibilities

Obligated boiler manufacturers bear the credit-purchase or £500 payment-in-lieu cost, with exposure capped at £500 per missing credit;

https://www.doloop.energy/item/c2beefb4289b47b9
